	<h1>Physical Sovereignty</h1>
	<p>
		True independence means owning the entire chain — from the creation of the work to the moment it lands in the customer's hands. Corporate platforms take a cut of every sale and the customer relationship with it. We build the chain so you hold both ends.
	</p>

	<h2 class="service">The Indie-Author Launchpad</h2>
	<p>
		Fulfillment-as-a-Service for independent authors: storage plus shipping, so you can focus on the writing. Batchable operations on fixed ship days — lean logistics built on enterprise-grade supply chain logic (QC, bin systems, flow optimization) adapted for the indie scale.
	</p>

	<h2 class="service">Fulfillment Consultation</h2>
	<p>
		The high-impact on-ramp. Expert guidance on lean logistics, zero-plastic packaging, and inventory systems — for authors and small businesses not yet ready to outsource. We teach the "how" before we handle the "do."
	</p>
	<p>
		Start with the <strong>Shipping Sovereignty Audit</strong>: a flat-fee analysis of your packaging, postage, and workflow, mapping the path from bedroom chaos to a lean, sovereign logistics operation.
	</p>

	<h2 class="service">The Sovereign Author Package</h2>
	<p>
		The premium, integrated offering: physical fulfillment plus your own <strong>Digital Fortress</strong> — a self-hosted storefront (Medusa), private mailing lists (listmonk), and archival sovereignty. Your store, your customer data, no platform tax. The backbone of the <a href="/catalog">FOSS Sovereignty Catalog</a>.
	</p>

	<h2 class="service">The Anti-KDP Guarantee</h2>
	<p>
		Unlike corporate platforms, the author owns the customer relationship and the data. Total ownership. No parasitic middlemen taking their cut of every page.
	</p>

	<h2 class="service">Sustainable Logistics</h2>
	<p>
		Compostable, plant-based packaging: paper mailers, paper tape, zero plastic. Lean, non-corporate supply chain methods that minimize the footprint on the planet while minimizing the cost to you.
	</p>
